      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claude-howto is a visual, example-driven guide that helps developers quickly master Claude Code's capabilities through practical templates. It stands out by organizing complex AI concepts into copy-paste templates that demonstrate real-world applications, making advanced techniques immediately accessible. Developers can use these templates as starting points for building custom agents, experimenting with prompt engineering, or integrating Claude Code into their workflows—turning theoretical knowledge into working implementations.",
        "zh": "Claude-howto 是一个可视化、示例驱动的教程项目，通过可复用的模板帮助开发者快速掌握 Claude Code 从基础概念到高级代理的全套技能。其核心设计在于将复杂的 AI 概念转化为即插即用的代码模板，让用户通过实际案例理解抽象原理，降低了学习门槛。开发者可直接复制这些模板来构建自定义智能体、尝试提示工程优化，或将 Claude Code 集成到现有项目中，实现从理论到实践的平滑过渡。",
        "es": "Claude-howto is a visual, example-driven guide that helps developers quickly master Claude Code's capabilities through practical templates. It stands out by organizing complex AI concepts into copy-paste templates that demonstrate real-world applications, making advanced techniques immediately accessible. Developers can use these templates as starting points for building custom agents, experimenting with prompt engineering, or integrating Claude Code into their workflows—turning theoretical knowledge into working implementations.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claude-howto stands out for claude-code, guide, and tutorial in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Claude-howto is a visual, example-driven guide that helps developers quickly master Claude Code's capabilities through practical templates. It stands out by organizing complex AI concepts into copy-paste templates that demonstrate real-world applications, making advanced techniques immediately accessible. Developers can use these templates as starting points for building custom agents, experimenting with prompt engineering, or integrating Claude Code into their workflows—turning theoretical knowledge into working implementations.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/luongnv89/claude-howto for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
